@startuml
title HSS activation fallout - Order fallout creation

participant "Fallout\nManagement" as FM #lightgrey
participant "Event\nManagement" as Event #grey
participant "Resource Order\nManagement" as ROM #blue

note right of ROM : continued from\nchapter 5.1.1.1

ROM -> Event : 1 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event resourceOrderException
activate Event
Event --> ROM : 2 **TMF688** 201 Created

Event -> FM : 3 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/resourceOrderException
activate FM
FM --> Event : 4 **TMF688** 201 Created
deactivate Event

FM -> FM : 5 Create fallout

FM -> Event : 6 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event falloutCreate (falloutId, state="Created")
activate Event
Event --> FM : 7 **TMF688** 201 Created
deactivate Event
deactivate FM

note left of FM : continued in\nchapter 5.1.1.3

@enduml
